# 🚀 Real Use Example (Interview Level)

- Printer install nahi ho raha → `gpresult`
- Policy apply nahi ho rahi → `gpupdate /force`
- System slow → `chkdsk`
- Windows error → `sfc /scannow`
- USB block/unblock → `gpedit.msc`

